# <%= projectName %> Architecture

This document describes the architecture and design decisions for your SaaS application.

## Overview

<%= projectName %> is a full-stack SaaS application built with a modern tech stack, organized as a monorepo using Nx. The architecture follows a clean separation of concerns with three main applications and shared libraries.

